@startuml 34-PersonalKnowledgePart1_Sequence
title 34-PersonalKnowledgePart1 — Normative execution sequence
actor Caller
participant Runtime
database LocalState
participant Dependency
Caller -> Runtime: request + trusted context
Runtime -> Runtime: normalize and validate
Runtime -> LocalState: load preconditions
Runtime -> Dependency: bounded operation
Dependency --> Runtime: result / acknowledgement
Runtime -> LocalState: persist durable state
Runtime -> Runtime: verify invariants
Runtime --> Caller: result + diagnostics
@enduml
